WEBVTT

00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:12.090
Hey…

00:00:15.090 --> 00:00:15.710
Hey…

00:00:17.930 --> 00:00:18.720
What’s wrong?

00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:21.550
Does your stomach hurt?

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:32.260
Let us be off.

00:00:33.490 --> 00:00:36.990
This is the story of a promise.

00:00:42.710 --> 00:00:44.730
It is a fairy tale about a great demon queen

00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:49.370
and the lone young man who devoted everything to her.

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:51.660
Back then,

00:00:52.010 --> 00:00:54.280
I still believed that this story began on that day.

00:00:54.680 --> 00:00:56.290
That is what I had always believed.

00:00:57.010 --> 00:00:59.100
Since the Empire had been overthrown,

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:02.550
the rebel Balkan lords could no longer enter the country—

00:01:02.550 --> 00:01:03.510
It’s Dracula!

00:01:05.940 --> 00:01:08.100
That’s… right.

00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:12.030
That example was about Romania’s Vlad Ţepeș.

00:01:12.030 --> 00:01:12.840
Wh–What?

00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:14.710
Dracula really existed?

00:01:14.710 --> 00:01:16.010
You didn’t know?

00:01:16.010 --> 00:01:17.910
Wasn’t that princess also named “Ţepeș”?

00:01:17.910 --> 00:01:21.120
Please be quiet. Quiet, everyone!

00:01:21.120 --> 00:01:24.540
Vlad III is just a common model used for movies—

00:01:28.080 --> 00:01:29.290
Sister Laura.

00:01:30.090 --> 00:01:31.410
Y–Yes?

00:01:32.760 --> 00:01:35.060
I’m sorry, but I can’t hold it in.

00:01:35.920 --> 00:01:36.830
Oh, all right…

00:01:37.430 --> 00:01:38.450
Go ahead.

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:39.750
What’s with that?

00:01:39.750 --> 00:01:40.800
Don’t scare me like that.

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:42.960
Geez, whatever will we do with you?

00:01:44.740 --> 00:01:47.540
“Vampires” were the hot topic at the time.

00:01:48.210 --> 00:01:51.340
However, whenever the topic came up,

00:01:51.340 --> 00:01:53.210
his mood would worsen for some reason.

00:01:54.370 --> 00:01:57.060
That’s right. I didn’t know yet.

00:01:58.570 --> 00:02:02.500
He himself had also forgotten at that time.

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:05.580
Dammit. Why?

00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:08.100
My heart feels restless.

00:02:09.060 --> 00:02:11.990
Their story began long ago.

00:02:12.780 --> 00:02:17.310
It was long ago. Long before I met Kaburagi Akira-kun,

00:02:17.310 --> 00:02:18.620
that this tale began.

00:02:22.990 --> 00:02:25.350
According to an announcement by the Prime Minister,

00:02:25.350 --> 00:02:31.690
Mina Ţepeș has legally purchased the rights to the entire Tokyo Land Reclamation #0.

00:02:31.690 --> 00:02:34.270
As a result, the government is being pressed about the situation.

00:02:35.150 --> 00:02:36.250
Are you serious?

00:02:36.550 --> 00:02:38.920
Vampires sure have a lot of money…

00:02:38.920 --> 00:02:41.930
Who would believe in vampires?

00:02:41.930 --> 00:02:43.930
Hey, I saw it on last week’s Astraea.

00:02:44.650 --> 00:02:45.930
They’re real.

00:02:46.240 --> 00:02:49.830
But if vampires are real, then maybe other things are, too.

00:02:49.830 --> 00:02:51.060
Like werewolves.

00:02:51.460 --> 00:02:53.060
Or Frankenstein?

00:02:58.630 --> 00:02:59.410
Yuki?

00:03:00.090 --> 00:03:01.610
Bento delivery service!

00:03:09.480 --> 00:03:10.600
Safe!

00:03:12.560 --> 00:03:14.020
You mean out!

00:03:15.150 --> 00:03:15.850
You saw them.

00:03:15.850 --> 00:03:16.920
I didn’t.

00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:18.300
You’re lying!

00:03:18.300 --> 00:03:19.170
You definitely saw them.

00:03:19.170 --> 00:03:20.920
I said I didn’t!

00:03:23.910 --> 00:03:27.270
Fine, I saw them. I happened to see them. Sorry.

00:03:27.790 --> 00:03:29.690
I’ll forget about them soon, so it’s fine, right?

00:03:30.330 --> 00:03:31.520
I don’t want that either.

00:03:31.920 --> 00:03:33.200
Which is it?

00:03:33.790 --> 00:03:38.360
Well, if you’re like that, it seems like you’re not interested in these things…

00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:40.450
Huh? Did you say something?

00:03:47.960 --> 00:03:49.570
Thank you, Yuki.

00:03:51.020 --> 00:03:52.760
You came because you were worried, right?

00:03:53.290 --> 00:03:54.690
Since I, you know…

00:03:55.180 --> 00:03:57.250
Since I ran out of class.

00:03:58.270 --> 00:03:59.000
Blockhead.

00:03:59.000 --> 00:03:59.790
Huh?

00:04:00.250 --> 00:04:01.200
Forget it.

00:04:01.830 --> 00:04:02.880
Saegusa-san?

00:04:03.330 --> 00:04:06.610
There’s something I wanted to ask you regarding the Treasurer’s Report.

00:04:06.610 --> 00:04:08.000
Do you have a moment?

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:09.340
Of course, President.

00:04:15.840 --> 00:04:17.940
Man, he’s so spineless.

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:23.810
Well, would it have been better to go along with it?

00:04:24.490 --> 00:04:26.410
Then you’d deserve to get beaten up.

00:04:26.960 --> 00:04:27.800
See?

00:04:31.780 --> 00:04:33.500
Saegusa’s great, isn’t she?

00:04:34.190 --> 00:04:34.930
Yeah…

00:04:37.400 --> 00:04:40.530
Hey, why aren’t you serious about it?

00:04:41.120 --> 00:04:43.250
Serious about what?

00:04:44.310 --> 00:04:45.260
Lots of things.

00:04:47.790 --> 00:04:50.960
It’s hard to put it into words, but I have a feeling…

00:04:51.760 --> 00:04:53.770
…that things are fine this way.

00:04:54.590 --> 00:04:57.860
You really have changed…

00:04:58.370 --> 00:05:01.390
You used be a lot cooler… or something…

00:05:04.350 --> 00:05:06.110
But I guess there’s no helping it.

00:05:07.570 --> 00:05:08.290
My bad.

00:05:09.340 --> 00:05:10.780
Ah, there he is.

00:05:10.780 --> 00:05:11.550
Kuze!

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:14.960
Can you let us use the broadcasting room after school?

00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:16.460
We need the Student Council’s permission.

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:19.760
Huh? I can, but… what for?

00:05:19.760 --> 00:05:22.340
Princess Mina’s doing another interview!

00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:24.050
We want to see it on the big screen.

00:05:24.050 --> 00:05:28.170
Ah, then I can’t give you permission. There’s no way vampires exist.

00:05:28.170 --> 00:05:30.050
Don’t be manipulated by the mass media.

00:05:31.720 --> 00:05:33.930
Kaburagi, say something!

00:05:34.300 --> 00:05:35.790
You want to see Mina-chan too, right?

00:05:36.190 --> 00:05:37.680
Mina-chan?

00:05:37.680 --> 00:05:39.560
Seriously? Wake up, man.

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:43.880
This is Mina-chan we’re talking about here. The famous Vampire Queen!

00:05:45.440 --> 00:05:46.430
Oh.

00:05:46.430 --> 00:05:47.920
Don’t give me that!

00:05:47.920 --> 00:05:51.130
Weren’t you also interviewed on that Astraea show?

00:05:51.130 --> 00:05:53.360
I’m not really interested.

00:05:53.800 --> 00:05:55.640
I don’t watch the news or TV, either.

00:05:57.350 --> 00:05:59.410
Ah, hey, Kaburagi!

00:06:06.660 --> 00:06:09.190
Another conversation about vampires.

00:06:09.950 --> 00:06:12.370
What’s wrong with me?

00:06:37.420 --> 00:06:38.790
Do you have some business with me?

00:06:39.850 --> 00:06:40.410
Hey!

00:06:40.820 --> 00:06:41.350
Stay away!

00:07:08.590 --> 00:07:09.570
Akira-kun?

00:07:38.450 --> 00:07:40.260
Will you really be okay by yourself?

00:07:40.610 --> 00:07:41.410
Yeah…

00:07:42.500 --> 00:07:44.710
Sorry for making you worry.

00:07:46.520 --> 00:07:48.360
You really surprised me.

00:07:48.910 --> 00:07:49.700
Yeah…

00:07:50.820 --> 00:07:51.980
I was also surprised.

00:07:55.900 --> 00:07:58.080
You know, head injuries are pretty scary…

00:07:58.520 --> 00:08:01.010
Something like that might happen again.

00:08:01.650 --> 00:08:05.430
You need to face your fears, and listen to what the doctor says.

00:08:08.130 --> 00:08:09.210
I got it.

00:08:09.690 --> 00:08:11.150
Then promise me.

00:08:11.510 --> 00:08:15.030
Promise that you’ll see a doctor about what happened today and have him take a look at you.

00:08:16.990 --> 00:08:18.150
Don’t worry.

00:08:18.150 --> 00:08:19.400
I’ll make sure I go.

00:08:32.760 --> 00:08:35.090
Never serious… huh?

00:08:40.720 --> 00:08:44.200
First: Drink from the lifeblood of humans.

00:08:49.130 --> 00:08:52.680
Second: Live an unrestrained life with an immortal body.

00:08:53.800 --> 00:08:56.850
Third: If anyone attempts to disrupt the order of this world…

00:08:58.420 --> 00:09:00.430
Then slay him!

00:09:02.180 --> 00:09:03.600
Mina Ţepeș!

00:09:03.890 --> 00:09:05.330
The one and only.

00:09:05.940 --> 00:09:07.870
Is this for real?

00:09:08.280 --> 00:09:12.860
Are you wondering whether or not I am a vampire?

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:17.330
Or are you perhaps inquiring whether I am the real Mina Ţepeș or not?

00:09:18.060 --> 00:09:20.930
Whichever the question, the answer shall be no different.

00:09:21.350 --> 00:09:23.780
I am a genuine—

00:09:24.060 --> 00:09:25.280
H–Hey!

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:26.410
Wait!

00:09:38.370 --> 00:09:41.730
It’s impossible to move in this thing!

00:09:51.070 --> 00:09:53.400
Do not assume that I am always like this.

00:09:54.500 --> 00:09:56.360
Why did you come to me?

00:09:58.150 --> 00:10:00.390
Why were you crying back there?

00:10:02.960 --> 00:10:06.790
You truly… don’t remember anything, do you?

00:10:09.680 --> 00:10:10.600
Princess!

00:10:14.900 --> 00:10:17.570
Dammit! What the hell’s going on?

00:10:18.840 --> 00:10:20.010
You…?

00:10:21.430 --> 00:10:23.490
Why did I… protect you…?

00:10:43.020 --> 00:10:45.360
Oh my. Has it already begun?

00:10:45.360 --> 00:10:48.620
No, that’s a different lot.

00:10:48.620 --> 00:10:49.700
I see.

00:10:50.050 --> 00:10:54.800
It seems that a veritable mountain of people were waiting for a chance like this.

00:10:56.180 --> 00:10:57.790
We apologize for the inconvenience.

00:10:57.790 --> 00:11:02.220
Due to an explosion of unknown origin in the neighborhood, service has been temporarily suspended.

00:11:03.610 --> 00:11:04.550
Huh?

00:11:05.680 --> 00:11:07.550
What was with those guys?

00:11:07.830 --> 00:11:12.440
Well, it appears that numerous people are after my life.

00:11:12.440 --> 00:11:15.160
Humans and non-humans alike.

00:11:15.160 --> 00:11:17.310
So why did they do that all of a sudden?!

00:11:17.310 --> 00:11:19.340
There are people like that, as well.

00:11:19.890 --> 00:11:23.460
At any rate, I will not perish so easily.

00:11:24.220 --> 00:11:27.310
Well, until now, at least…

00:11:28.160 --> 00:11:30.600
The Lightblocking Gel is about to lose its effectiveness.

00:11:31.110 --> 00:11:32.410
Lightblocking Gel?

00:11:32.730 --> 00:11:37.310
It is the ointment we use to counter the cell destruction caused by exposure to the sun.

00:11:37.960 --> 00:11:39.590
It will not last another minute.

00:11:40.210 --> 00:11:42.280
What will happen then?

00:11:42.550 --> 00:11:44.420
I will be reduced to ashes.

00:11:44.420 --> 00:11:46.690
Hey, don’t say that so casually!

00:11:47.540 --> 00:11:50.780
Now then, just <i>what</i> shall I do?

00:11:50.780 --> 00:11:53.600
I have some of that very gel here, but…

00:11:58.190 --> 00:12:01.950
Dammit! Why am I going along with something like this?

00:12:02.760 --> 00:12:03.760
I wonder why.

00:12:03.760 --> 00:12:06.900
That’s what I want to know, <i>Princess</i>.

00:12:10.600 --> 00:12:13.620
I cannot remove these clothes all by myself.

00:12:16.570 --> 00:12:21.080
Are you doubting your ability to control yourself once you have laid eyes upon my naked body?

00:12:23.460 --> 00:12:25.820
Who would want such an immature body?

00:12:27.430 --> 00:12:29.800
Such an immature…

00:12:31.730 --> 00:12:33.610
An immature body, you say?

00:12:34.450 --> 00:12:36.560
Indeed… it is…

00:12:38.810 --> 00:12:40.710
I have to rub it on you, too?!

00:12:40.970 --> 00:12:42.550
What is the matter?

00:12:42.550 --> 00:12:45.710
Given my immature body, you should be fine with this, should you not?

00:12:45.710 --> 00:12:48.240
Of course! I have no problems with this!

00:12:55.540 --> 00:13:00.750
Hey, have they always been targeting you like this?

00:13:00.990 --> 00:13:02.000
Veritably so.

00:13:02.730 --> 00:13:05.090
Then why were you out walking by yourself?

00:13:05.550 --> 00:13:07.140
What’s up with that?

00:13:12.320 --> 00:13:15.450
My pinky finger beckoned me here.

00:13:22.970 --> 00:13:25.690
That is why I took a gamble, and revealed myself.

00:13:26.840 --> 00:13:29.170
But it appears that I lost that gamble.

00:13:34.750 --> 00:13:35.490
Who’s there?

00:13:36.780 --> 00:13:37.760
It’s the police!

00:13:38.570 --> 00:13:40.870
There was an explosion in the neighborhood.

00:13:40.870 --> 00:13:42.860
What are you two doing here?

00:13:42.860 --> 00:13:44.860
Would you mind if we asked you a few questions?

00:13:45.070 --> 00:13:45.890
Stay back!

00:14:05.900 --> 00:14:09.380
How uncanny of you to discern that these two were assassins.

00:14:09.860 --> 00:14:12.860
I smelled it somehow…

00:14:13.920 --> 00:14:15.870
A human, are you?

00:14:15.870 --> 00:14:17.640
Whose subordinate?

00:14:18.230 --> 00:14:21.310
Well, I need not force an answer from you.

00:14:21.310 --> 00:14:24.240
Sooner or later, you will divulge that of your own free will.

00:14:27.280 --> 00:14:30.250
Behold. This is what I am.

00:14:30.250 --> 00:14:32.940
The true form of the Vampire Queen.

00:14:49.260 --> 00:14:52.080
That was Akira-kun, right?

00:14:56.020 --> 00:14:59.070
If we go there, no one will lay a hand on us.

00:15:00.380 --> 00:15:01.830
You have my gratitude.

00:15:03.420 --> 00:15:07.000
You’re… really a vampire, aren’t you?

00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:09.750
That is what I have been saying since the very beginning.

00:15:11.930 --> 00:15:13.890
Why did you suddenly reveal yourself,

00:15:13.890 --> 00:15:16.360
and create your own country?

00:15:18.580 --> 00:15:21.170
Battle preparations, perhaps…

00:15:24.500 --> 00:15:26.410
In that case, I have a question for you.

00:15:27.430 --> 00:15:29.770
Are you happy the way you are now?

00:15:32.150 --> 00:15:34.300
I have no memories.

00:15:36.940 --> 00:15:39.570
I had an accident around this time last year.

00:15:41.040 --> 00:15:42.510
Laughable, isn’t it?

00:15:42.510 --> 00:15:44.390
16 years gone, just like that.

00:15:46.270 --> 00:15:48.850
But… even like this…

00:15:49.330 --> 00:15:55.070
I made friends like them—people who are concerned about me.

00:15:57.020 --> 00:15:58.320
That’s why…

00:16:00.100 --> 00:16:00.850
Probably.

00:16:07.420 --> 00:16:09.790
Farewell then. I shall take my leave.

00:16:19.080 --> 00:16:19.900
Akira.

00:16:27.300 --> 00:16:30.650
I cried because I was happy to see you.

00:16:31.540 --> 00:16:33.420
How do you know my name?

00:16:42.070 --> 00:16:43.930
I have been waiting for you.

00:16:45.390 --> 00:16:50.500
Although it is late, I have been instructed to escort you, Your Royal Highness.

00:16:50.500 --> 00:16:51.470
Oh?

00:16:51.470 --> 00:16:52.480
Where to?

00:16:53.160 --> 00:16:54.590
To our organization.

00:16:55.510 --> 00:16:57.060
A different group, huh?

00:16:57.060 --> 00:16:57.970
H-Hey!

00:16:57.970 --> 00:16:58.860
Stay back!

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:00.730
This is the domain of the night.

00:17:00.990 --> 00:17:03.910
You who live in the sunlight must not set foot here!

00:17:06.940 --> 00:17:09.730
Look at me, Your Royal Highness!

00:17:12.990 --> 00:17:14.000
You…

00:17:16.690 --> 00:17:18.380
It’s useless!

00:17:18.380 --> 00:17:20.670
Of whose blood are you?!

00:17:20.890 --> 00:17:22.030
Dammit!

00:17:22.160 --> 00:17:23.740
Don’t get in my way!

00:17:45.370 --> 00:17:46.320
Stop it!

00:17:46.320 --> 00:17:47.740
He has nothing to do with this!

00:17:53.110 --> 00:17:56.860
Oh? Is he that important to you?

00:17:58.490 --> 00:18:00.930
Just as I thought. In that case…

00:18:04.620 --> 00:18:06.650
Stop!!

00:18:08.050 --> 00:18:10.750
Why… do you cry?

00:18:11.820 --> 00:18:13.350
Why are you crying?

00:18:14.280 --> 00:18:16.050
Does your stomach hurt?

00:18:19.860 --> 00:18:21.690
Princess…?

00:18:22.680 --> 00:18:23.710
Don’t cry.

00:18:24.500 --> 00:18:25.680
I’ll make you a promise.

00:18:26.680 --> 00:18:28.190
I will protect you.

00:18:29.050 --> 00:18:30.700
I’ll always be by your side.

00:18:31.190 --> 00:18:31.990
That’s why…

00:18:32.880 --> 00:18:33.710
That’s why…

00:18:34.740 --> 00:18:36.310
You shouldn’t cry…

00:18:37.110 --> 00:18:38.940
Akira!

00:18:43.710 --> 00:18:44.950
Crushed!

00:19:08.120 --> 00:19:09.390
It can’t be!

00:19:09.390 --> 00:19:10.510
He’s…

00:19:11.630 --> 00:19:12.520
That’s right.

00:19:13.150 --> 00:19:13.930
I am…

00:19:14.740 --> 00:19:17.020
The Earth Clan!

00:19:17.930 --> 00:19:18.940
S–Stay back!

00:19:25.680 --> 00:19:26.560
Akira!

00:19:42.310 --> 00:19:45.930
This is the story of a promise.

00:19:46.430 --> 00:19:47.420
Akira…

00:19:50.140 --> 00:19:54.980
A story about a great demon queen, and the young man who devoted everything to her…

00:19:56.240 --> 00:19:59.650
Beautiful, and ephemeral…

00:19:59.650 --> 00:20:02.980
A fairy tale of love.

00:20:05.550 --> 00:20:07.770
Dance with the Vampire Maids!

00:20:07.770 --> 00:20:08.610
Part Two!

00:20:09.610 --> 00:20:11.000
What? What’s going on?

00:20:11.000 --> 00:20:13.660
How dare you put your filthy paws all over Her Highness!

00:20:14.410 --> 00:20:16.400
Let death take you!

00:20:16.400 --> 00:20:18.740
It’s all right! It’ll only hurt the first time.

00:20:19.910 --> 00:20:23.270
You’ve got to be kidding me! Who’d enjoy touching that flat washboard?!

00:20:23.270 --> 00:20:25.930
Oh? So I am a flat washboard?

00:20:26.240 --> 00:20:26.800
Huh?

00:20:26.800 --> 00:20:29.570
Who wants some werewolf fillet?

00:20:29.570 --> 00:20:30.670
We do!

00:20:30.670 --> 00:20:32.810
It’s all right. It’ll only hurt the first time!
